 "text": "Skip to Main Content\n\ninfo@mazingirasafari.com\n\n+255784278205\n\nAbout Us\nContact\nFAQ's\nYour Trip\nTravel Info\nBlog\nAccessibility Statement for Mazingira Safari\nAccessibility Statement for Mazingira Safari\n​\nCommitment to Accessibility\n\nAt Mazingira Safari, we are committed to providing an accessible website experience for all our users, regardless of their physical abilities or limitations. We strive to ensure that our website complies with the highest standards of accessibility and usability, adhering to both UK and Tanzanian legal requirements.\n\nLegal Requirements\n\nOur accessibility efforts are guided by the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.1, Level AA, which are recognized globally as the benchmark for web accessibility. We aim to meet or exceed these guidelines to ensure that our website is accessible to as many people as possible. This includes compliance with the Equality Act 2010 in the UK and relevant accessibility regulations in Tanzania.\n\n​\n\nMeasures to Support Accessibility\n​\n\nTo ensure our website is accessible, we have implemented the following measures:\n\nAlternative Text for Images: All images on our website include descriptive alt text to assist users who rely on screen readers.\n\nKeyboard Navigation: Our website is fully navigable using a keyboard to accommodate users with mobility impairments.\n\nContrast and Readability: We use high-contrast text and background combinations to improve readability for users with visual impairments.\n\nResponsive Design: Our website is designed to be fully responsive, providing an optimal viewing experience on a variety of devices, including mobile phones and tablets.\n\nRegular Audits: We conduct regular accessibility audits to identify and address any potential issues. Feedback from users is highly valued and helps us continuously improve our website's accessibility.\n\n​\n\nAssistance and Feedback\n\nIf you encounter any accessibility barriers on our website or have suggestions for improvement, please contact us. We are committed to making our website as accessible as possible and will do our best to address any issues promptly.\n\nEmail: info@mazingirasafari.com\n\nPhone: +255 784278205 (Tanzania) \n\nMail: Mazingira Safari, P.O. Box 12345, Arusha, Tanzania\n\n​\n\nContinuous Improvement\n\nWe are dedicated to continuous improvement and regularly update our accessibility practices to ensure we meet current guidelines and best practices. We work with accessibility experts and incorporate user feedback to enhance the user experience for everyone.\n\n​\n\nLegal Compliance\n\nThis accessibility statement was prepared to comply with the legal requirements in the UK and Tanzania. We regularly review our compliance to ensure we meet the necessary standards and regulations.\n\nThank you for visiting Mazingira Safari. We are committed to making our website accessible to all users and appreciate your support in our efforts to provide an inclusive online experience\n\nWidget Didn’t Load\nCheck your internet and refresh this page.\nIf that doesn’t work, contact us.\nRefresh this page\nContact us\n\ninfo@mazingirasafari.com\n\nuk.sales@mazingirasafari.com\n\n+255784278205 / +255767278204\n\nAccessibility Statement \n\nMazingira Eco Friendly Safari Adventure\n\nArusha \n\nP.O Box 12544\n\nStay informed, join our newsletter\n\nEnter your email here \nSubscribe\n\nMazingira Safari © 2023 | ",
